\f1 \cf0 \strokec2 \uc0\u55357 \u57056 \u65039 
\f2\b  What Is Claude Code?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf0 \strokec2 Claude Code is an AI-powered coding assistant that helps you build features, fix bugs, and automate development tasks. It understands your entire codebase and can work across multiple files and tools.\
As of late 2025, there is an easier way to access Claude Code through Claude Desktop, which is much easier for non-technical users to use, though it has slightly fewer features than the command-line interface. The web and desktop versions give you the same core Claude Code capabilities through a familiar, point-and-click interface \'97 no terminal required.\
So Claude Code would give you an even more autonomous experience \'97 it can write files directly to your computer, run commands itself, and iterate without you copy-pasting anything. But it does require a Claude subscription beyond the free tier and a quick install.\
Claude Code makes development accessible to anyone with an idea. The ability to describe a goal in plain language and get working software back has opened development to people outside engineering.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

